<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta carried out double-tap airstrikes that hit civilian displacement camps, killing 12 people including a five-year-old and injuring many others. Junta forces also destroyed bridges after bombing villages and advanced west of the Sittaung River, forcing civilians to flee. ASEAN members remain divided, with the bloc refusing to ease restrictions on Myanmar’s leadership and its special envoy confirming the stance. The military government is seeking investment for rare-earth projects while summoning the German envoy over a controversial video. 2,332 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOelhQTXluM0EyUV9QWEJ4NFdkWk5NQVFzTm5kWUFyQkk3UXdUMlVsOVFlNmpNMzZ1ZVlDYy1nbldweC00RW1uQnFQU1NnT0RzNTZzS3ZHN0w5RDZiQ1dOVjlkZk03djltN1VEZUlNci14NFdSYXRqZEZLbzNFZ2dSbUNCcW9ZQl9ZSmdTcXdkd05raUJoZl9INTh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNb2plekZ4aE15TUFLemFKblVBdWYySzdRMHNRbmhpZjc2dkxQOWxHMG9qQmQxUFpfNTRkcHNWYkNKQXVveUtnSUxqNG00Q2hjQ0lJWWZaMUc4RUxkVWtUOGZhQUk0MGJEUHVuSDRkZmFSZ2x5VFR0bFUzOVl1OVE0R0lBR2RYZHpIdE4wYzRyZ3haRjZweFhPVVpZNF91Ynpad1k1T0RXUndNNXQzb2xEcXNyaUVJd1Y3Z1lIWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPZl9XaGdMNHJBNTVxcTNBOG1TWW5iRlllRmExM0o5Y2VCT0llS1ZuZGxRV1lZcTNDUGQyMjFQSlhYajQwNUxVQ0xRSldHU3NzRjdDdmFjMm9sdUlVMm1pN2NxM19zZkVaT1hzMlJETVF4R0tEZlF0MkFVV0I5T0I0WEo1c0wyZGEtaVZub2dOMXRqYmV2ekdnMUp2alZCT3FuMHcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business &amp;amp; Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOMVBaMFJGY3RVRFFhSC1jWTJrR2s5c19mY1BJMnZvcWNPUzBDZXdvTVZXd3J1aFlUZEhrMmNOS2Y3Q0VyanZrV0